*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_NR_DL_Test_Model_Activation_TddBbPoolOn_Fail
    [Documentation]
    ...  Starts NR Downlink Test Model and waits for activation fail.
    ...  Proper reason of fail is confirmed with BTS log analysis.
    ...  * REQUIREMENTS:  SCF parameter actBbPoolTddFr1 must be set on True in test preconditions.
    ...
    ...  :param str test_model: (Mandatory) One of following NR DL test models supported for cell configuration:
    ...                                     "TM1.1", "TM1.2",
    ...                                     "TM2", "TM2A",
    ...                                     "TM3.1", "TM3.1A", "TM3.2", "TM3.3", "TM3.3N",
    ...                                     "TM1.1_ETSI"
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : Global cell id of tested NR cell.
    ...  :param int or list beam_id: (Optional) : beam pattern id parameter, default 0.
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) : timeout (in seconds) for test startup and termination, default 60.

    [Arguments]                                             ${test_model}
    ...                                                     ${cell_id}
    ...                                                     ${beam_id}=0
    ...                                                     ${timeout}=60

    [Timeout]                                               24 hours

    Create admin session with default alias
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${cells_params}                                         tm_setup_adm.get_cell_parameters_required_to_setup_test_model
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${beam_pattern_id}                                      tm_startup.prepare_beam_id_parameter
    ...                                                     ${beam_id}

    Robot Log Variable                                      Parameters required to TM start: ${cells_params}

    ${start_tm_timestamp}         Get Current Date          result_format=%H:%M:%S.%f

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting Test Model '${test_model}' and waiting for fail...

    ${tm_result}                  tm_nr_adm.start_5g_downlink_test
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model.replace('-', '_').replace('.', '_')}
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${cells_params["distname_runtime"]}
    ...                                                     phys_cell_id=${cells_params["phy_cellid"]}
    ...                                                     beam_id=${beam_pattern_id}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

    ${stop_tm_timestamp}          Get Current Date          result_format=%H:%M:%S.%f

    Robot Log Result                                        Test Model run result is: ${tm_result["status"]}
    Robot Log Variable                                      Msg of TM result: ${tm_result["msg"]}

    Should be equal as strings                              ${tm_result["status"]}      Failed
    ...                                                     msg=Test model should fail, actual run status is ${tm_result["status"]}

    ${first_msg}                  Set variable              NRBTS_A has activated FR1 TDD baseband resource pooling
    ${second_msg}                 Set variable              Checking preconditions for test model failed

    ${first_msg_in_btslog}                                  btslog_parser.check_if_message_exists
    ...                                                     msg=${first_msg}
    ...                                                     start_timestamp=${start_tm_timestamp}
    ...                                                     stop_timestamp=${stop_tm_timestamp}

    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${first_msg_in_btslog}      True
    ...                                                     msg=Message '${first_msg}' NOT found in BTS log.

    ${second_msg_in_btslog}                                 btslog_parser.check_if_message_exists
    ...                                                     msg=${second_msg}
    ...                                                     start_timestamp=${start_tm_timestamp}
    ...                                                     stop_timestamp=${stop_tm_timestamp}

    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${second_msg_in_btslog}     True
    ...                                                     msg=Message '${second_msg}' NOT found in BTS log.

    [Teardown]                    Run keyword if            "${tm_result["status"]}"=="Success"
    ...                           Run keywords
    ...                           Robot Log Operation       Stopping test model'${test_model}'...
    ...                           AND
    ...                           tm_nr_adm.stop_5g_downlink_test
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${cells_params["distname_runtime"]}
    ...                                                     timeout=30
